{"t":"2026-11-13 20:45:41","event":"check","n":1,"evidence":"Uji 'the yard plays the trail of a ticket': hidup satu tiket per kejadian, sekaligus, dan dua tiket bercampur selalu memberi urutan adegan yang sama; dua check lalu submitted dalam satu pembacaan semuanya diputar. Di peramban dengan papan sekali pakai: new, move, start, check, check, uncheck tampil berurutan.","session":"8d42aae9-1e0c-48fb-81a4-8830384e089e","by":"worker:ac5fcf8b586a51f25"}
{"t":"2026-11-13 20:45:41","event":"check","n":2,"evidence":"Uji 'the yard is never ahead of the board...': 30 detik = 1x, 45 = 1.5x, 120 sampai 300 = 4x, lebih dari 300 detik = diletakkan tanpa adegan; papan tanpa kejadiannya tidak menggerakkan apa pun. Di peramban demo: digeser 100 detik menjadi 3.43x, 400 detik antrean kosong. Batas tertulis di docs/galangan-padanan.md bagian Linimasa.","session":"8d42aae9-1e0c-48fb-81a4-8830384e089e","by":"worker:ac5fcf8b586a51f25"}
{"t":"2026-11-13 20:45:42","event":"check","n":3,"evidence":"Uji 'a page just opened shows the board as it is, and plays no history': tiket di keenam status langsung di tempatnya, tak ada pemeran yang diberi pekerjaan, catatan adegan kosong. Di peramban, demo dan papan sungguhan pada detik 0 sudah lengkap dengan tertinggal 0.","session":"8d42aae9-1e0c-48fb-81a4-8830384e089e","by":"worker:ac5fcf8b586a51f25"}
{"t":"2026-11-13 20:45:42","event":"check","n":4,"evidence":"Uji 'a hull rises or falls only when a criterion is met, taken back or struck out': satu jam worker bekerja lambung tetap 0.25; check naik, uncheck turun, void berubah; kejadian lain, submitted, dan penolakan tanpa kriteria tidak mengubahnya. Di peramban lambung naik hanya sesudah k2 check.","session":"8d42aae9-1e0c-48fb-81a4-8830384e089e","by":"worker:ac5fcf8b586a51f25"}
{"t":"2026-11-13 20:45:42","event":"check","n":5,"evidence":"Uji 'what the trail does not carry shows from the board as it is': langkah agen, uji berjalan, agen macet, dan pertanyaan tampil seketika dari keadaan, sementara status dan lambung menunggu kejadiannya. Di tangkapan layar demo tukang dok menampilkan langkah agen.","session":"8d42aae9-1e0c-48fb-81a4-8830384e089e","by":"worker:ac5fcf8b586a51f25"}
{"t":"2026-11-13 20:45:42","event":"check","n":6,"evidence":"Uji 'a page that lost the viewer and found it again plays every scene once' dengan server dan k2 sungguhan: papan bergerak selagi dua pembacaan gagal; sesudah tersambung tiap adegan tepat satu kali dan berurutan, tiga pembacaan berikutnya tidak mengulang apa pun.","session":"8d42aae9-1e0c-48fb-81a4-8830384e089e","by":"worker:ac5fcf8b586a51f25"}
{"t":"2026-11-13 20:45:42","event":"check","n":7,"evidence":"Uji 'the demo makes up a trail too': tiket yang dipesan selama demo diputar dari created sampai landed (deliver, plan, start, pass, launch, berlabuh). Di peramban ?demo 160 detik: mail, shelf, queue, slip, bay, tanpa galat konsol. docs/galangan-padanan.md mendapat bagian Linimasa.","session":"8d42aae9-1e0c-48fb-81a4-8830384e089e","by":"worker:ac5fcf8b586a51f25"}
